<LegalPage title="Corrections and removals" description="Request a factual correction or removal for an airdrop record." path="/corrections/" kicker="CORRECTIONS / RECORD QUALITY">
  <p>Found an outdated reward, incorrect chain, broken source, or misleading requirement? Send the record URL, the specific field, and a current official source to <a class="text-link" href="mailto:editorial@topcryptoairdrops.com">editorial@topcryptoairdrops.com</a>.</p>
  <h2>What helps us act quickly</h2>
  <ul><li>The exact local record URL</li><li>A direct official announcement or documentation link</li><li>A short explanation of what changed and when</li></ul>
  <p>We review requests against available evidence. A correction may change the text, add a review flag, remove an external link, or take a record out of the index.</p>
</LegalPage>
